      "release_date": "2026-10-05",
      "release_notes": "Features:\n- Allow loading files with very long lines via prompt (#950) (Kai Willadsen)\n- Attach Windows and macOS builds to releases from CI (Kai Willadsen)\nFixes:\n- Raise the line length limit for loading files (Kai Willadsen)\n- Improve dark mode detection (g.willems)\n- Don't treat blank files as images when detecting image comparisons (g.willems)\n- Move Windows build to UCRT64 (Kai Willadsen)\n- Windows installer upgrade and uninstall fixes (Kai Willadsen)\nTranslations:\n- Anders Jonsson (sv)\n- Balázs Úr (hu)\n- Baurzhan Muftakhidinov (kk)\n- Ekaterine Papava (ka)\n- Martin (sl)\n- Rafael Fontenelle (pt_BR)\n- Yuri Chornoivan (uk)",
