    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "version": "3.24.0",
      "release_date": "2026-06-20",
      "release_notes": "Features:\n- Add support for building Meld as a Python wheel (Noam Raphael)\n- Add screenshot-and-exit behaviour for CI testing (Noam Raphael)\nFixes:\n- Avoid leaking file descriptors during matcher shutdown (#962) (Thomas Klausner)\n- Fix opening version control conflict with a single file argument (#486) (Kai Willadsen)\n- Fix crash when right-clicking on notebook (#949) (Kai Willadsen)\n- Don't discard all sides when one side changed on disk (#823) (ks132)\n- Fix diff updating in auto-merge comparisons (#957) (pknowles)\n- Allow intl-8 in addition to libintl-8 on windows, to support conda (Noam Raphael)\n- Fix opening comparison from folder compare with missing left file (#944) (Kai Willadsen)\n- Metadata fixes (Sabri Ünal)\nTranslations:\n- Alan Mortensen (da)\n- Baurzhan Muftakhidinov (kk)\n- Cheng-Chia Tseng (zh_TW)\n- Guillaume Bernard (fr)\n- Ibai Oihanguren Sala (eu)\n- Kai Willadsen (nb)\n- Марко Костић (sr)",
